WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:01.148
-Hey, guys.

00:00:01.148 --> 00:00:03.370
Mother's Day is coming up,
and in honor of that,

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:05.671
we've teamed up with Samsung
to celebrate some very special

00:00:05.671 --> 00:00:07.406
supermoms all week long.

00:00:07.406 --> 00:00:09.942
We asked people to nominate
an epic mom in their life --

00:00:09.942 --> 00:00:12.044
could be your mom
or a mom you know --

00:00:12.044 --> 00:00:14.313
just an amazing person who's
gone above and beyond

00:00:14.313 --> 00:00:16.849
to support their families
and friends and communities,

00:00:16.849 --> 00:00:18.584
especially through
this past year.

00:00:18.584 --> 00:00:20.453
So here's what we did.
We set up video chats

00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:23.757
with the moms and we told them
it was for NBC's Instagram.

00:00:23.757 --> 00:00:26.092
What we didn't tell them was
that I was going to call them

00:00:26.092 --> 00:00:31.297
on my new Samsung Galaxy
S21 Ultra 5G phone

00:00:31.297 --> 00:00:33.700
and surprise them with something
to make their Mother's Day

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.301
a little brighter.

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:37.370
Tonight's mom is Dedria Jackson.

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:39.872
She's an assistant principal at
Kipling Elementary School

00:00:39.872 --> 00:00:41.440
in Chicago, Illinois.

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:43.509
She was nominated by
her friend Laura.

00:00:43.509 --> 00:00:45.545
Check this out.

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:50.784
♪ "Tonight Show"
Supermom Surprise ♪

00:00:50.784 --> 00:00:56.022
-Hi, my name is Laura, and my
friend Dedria is a supermom

00:00:56.022 --> 00:00:57.790
because she's a mom.

00:00:57.790 --> 00:00:59.158
She's a grandmother, too.

00:00:59.158 --> 00:01:00.993
She's an assistant principal.

00:01:00.993 --> 00:01:04.697
It's a Chicago public school
and it's extremely diverse

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:06.198
and low-income.

00:01:06.198 --> 00:01:10.135
Dedria supported ensuring that
teachers, parents, and students

00:01:10.135 --> 00:01:13.773
could access remote learning
and work to ensure that

00:01:13.773 --> 00:01:16.508
all of the staff at her
elementary school

00:01:16.508 --> 00:01:20.679
were able to obtain vaccines to
return to school safely.

00:01:20.679 --> 00:01:23.616
She steps up, even when she's
not asked to --

00:01:23.616 --> 00:01:24.684
that's what a mom does.

00:01:24.684 --> 00:01:27.420
It's so much more than
just being a mom.

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:28.420
-D?

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:29.922
-Yes?
-D, are you there?

00:01:29.922 --> 00:01:31.157
Dedria? Wait, let me --

00:01:31.157 --> 00:01:33.559
Let me turn my video on.

00:01:33.559 --> 00:01:34.760
Dedria!

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:36.995
-Hi!

00:01:36.995 --> 00:01:38.631
-D, you're a supermom.

00:01:38.631 --> 00:01:40.833
Everything that you do
for the school.

00:01:40.833 --> 00:01:43.602
And I wanted to thank you
for being a supermom,

00:01:43.602 --> 00:01:46.306
and our friends at Samsung
wanted to thank you, as well.

00:01:46.306 --> 00:01:47.740
So we'd like to give you
this package --

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:50.009
it's a Galaxy Samsung package.

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:52.645
You get the brand new watch,
you get the Tab,

00:01:52.645 --> 00:01:54.847
you get the earbuds,
you get it all!

00:01:54.847 --> 00:01:56.315
-Thank you!
-From Samsung.

00:01:56.315 --> 00:01:57.684
Congratulations.
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:57.684 --> 00:02:00.419
Oh, my God! How awesome is that!

00:02:00.419 --> 00:02:01.654
-Dedria, one more thing.

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:07.693
Samsung wanted to give you
a check for $25,000.

00:02:07.693 --> 00:02:09.428
-Oh, my gosh!

00:02:09.428 --> 00:02:10.530
[ Laughs ]

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:11.798
-What?!

00:02:11.798 --> 00:02:14.100
-You are a supermom
and we wanted to thank you.

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:18.304
-Oh, my gosh!

00:02:18.304 --> 00:02:19.539
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:19.539 --> 00:02:21.374
-Are you serious?!

00:02:21.374 --> 00:02:23.109
-[ Laughs ] Yeah!

00:02:23.109 --> 00:02:25.044
-Oh, my God.

00:02:25.044 --> 00:02:27.046
-Happy early Mother's Day!

00:02:27.046 --> 00:02:28.448
Love from the "Tonight Show".

00:02:28.448 --> 00:02:29.715
Congratulations and thanks
for everything you do.

00:02:29.715 --> 00:02:30.516
-Both: Thank you!

00:02:30.516 --> 00:02:32.318
-Thank you so much!

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:34.687
-Oh, my God!

00:02:34.687 --> 00:02:35.855
-Aww.

00:02:35.855 --> 00:02:37.890
-My thank you to Dedria
and Laura,

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:40.260
Samsung, and all the supermoms
out there!

